faqPageIntro:"Trial, subscriptions, POS, data and hardware: the most common questions.",faqQ1:"How long is the trial?",faqA1:"7 days.",faqQ2:"What happens when the trial ends?",faqA2:"Your data is not deleted; paid features are simply limited until you activate a plan.",faqQ3:"How are multiple restaurants billed?",faqA3:"Planned billing is per location. Multiple restaurants can remain linked to the same ReMaPro account.",faqQ4:"Does ReMaPro replace my POS?",faqA4:"ReMaPro Hub is the management app. ReMaPro Complete will add ReMaPro POS for checkout when it becomes available.",faqQ5:"When will ReMaPro POS be available?",faqA5:"The POS is being finalized and hardware integration is under validation. A date will be announced after technical validation.",faqQ6:"Do I need a separate account for Hub and POS?",faqA6:"No. The same ReMaPro account gives access to both apps according to your subscription and permissions.",faqQ7:"Are tablets and employees billed separately?",faqA7:"The planned launch grid bills per location, without micro-surcharges per employee or POS tablet at the same restaurant.",faqQ8:"What hardware will work with ReMaPro POS?",faqA8:"We target standard thermal printers, attached cash drawers and officially integrated payment terminals. The validated hardware list will be published before POS launch.",faqCloudQ:"Where is my data stored?",faqCloudA:"Business data is synchronized in Supabase in Europe with organization- and restaurant-level access rules. Card data is not stored by ReMaPro."
